WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.464
[mouth drums in three, and a guitar over them]

00:14.464 --> 00:16.154
10 years of birthdays

00:18.189 --> 00:19.849
of libra season

00:21.494 --> 00:23.099
i still don't know what that means

00:23.889 --> 00:25.154
but it doesn't matter

00:27.129 --> 00:27.837
what matters to me

00:27.837 --> 00:29.177
is ten years of mornings

00:29.177 --> 00:30.837
that start with your blue eyes

00:30.837 --> 00:32.704
adjusting to the light

00:34.159 --> 00:34.769
of the sunrise

00:34.769 --> 00:36.849
golden hair that catches it

00:39.449 --> 00:41.029
10 years of adventure

00:42.209 --> 00:44.149
not one resembling the next

00:45.749 --> 00:47.239
you become more different

00:47.239 --> 00:48.229
every day

00:48.979 --> 00:50.819
more generous

00:50.819 --> 00:52.839
more comfortable in your own skin

00:54.339 --> 00:56.004
in who you are

00:56.004 --> 00:56.799
and less concerned

00:56.799 --> 00:58.839
with how the world sees you

00:58.839 --> 00:59.789
which is good

01:01.299 --> 01:02.429
because we have plenty of world

01:02.429 --> 01:04.409
left to see

01:04.409 --> 01:05.274
and plenty of life

01:05.274 --> 01:06.489
left to live

01:08.529 --> 01:10.174
i've had ten years

01:10.174 --> 01:12.174
to realize how lucky i am

01:12.174 --> 01:13.849
to push for the next hundred

01:14.679 --> 01:15.524
with you

01:16.644 --> 01:19.459
my love

01:20.897 --> 01:23.487
[sung] my love

01:25.115 --> 01:28.154
[sung] my love

01:29.332 --> 01:32.282
[sung] my love
